<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 200px;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">ART INTERNSHIP</h1>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">ACADEMIC CONTRACT</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 1 of 14</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Internship Coordinator</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of Art</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">University of Wyoming</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Dept. 3138, 1000 E. University Ave.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Laramie, WY 82071</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Phone: {{ employer.phone }}</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">E-mail: {{ employer.email }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Student's Name: <span data-field="student.full_name">{{ student.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>W#: <span data-field="student.w_number">{{ student.w_number }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="student.email">{{ student.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="student.phone">{{ student.phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="student.address">{{ student.address }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Name of Agency/Organization of Internship: <span data-field="agency.name">{{ agency.name }}</span></p>
    <p>Internship Supervisor: <span data-field="agency.supervisor_name">{{ agency.supervisor_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="agency.address">{{ agency.address }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="agency.email">{{ agency.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Period of Internship: From <span data-field="internship.start_date">{{ internship.start_date }}</span> To <span data-field="internship.end_date">{{ internship.end_date }}</span></p>
    <p>Hours per week on-the-job: <span data-field="internship.hours_per_week">{{ internship.hours_per_week }}</span></p>
    <p>General assignment for internship: <span data-field="internship.general_assignment">{{ internship.general_assignment }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Faculty Sponsor: <span data-field="faculty_sponsor.full_name">{{ faculty_sponsor.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="faculty_sponsor.email">{{ faculty_sponsor.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="faculty_sponsor.phone">{{ faculty_sponsor.phone }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">DEPARTMENT REQUIREMENTS</h2>

  <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>
      <p>Academic Credit</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Course Number</td>
            <td style="width: 30%;">Credit Hours</td>
            <td style="width: 40%;">Grade Option (A-F or S/U)</td>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="course.number">{{ course.number }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="course.credit_hours">{{ course.credit_hours }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="course.grade_option">{{ course.grade_option }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>Academic Assignments and due date for submission (arranged with faculty sponsor): <span data-field="academic_assignments.description">{{ academic_assignments.description }}</span></p>
      <p>Keep a journal and document the following during your internship:</p>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
        <li>Record of internship activity weekly/semi-weekly</li>
        <li>Record of new skills and learning acquired in work setting.</li>
        <li>Record of previous expertise and knowledge applied in work setting.</li>
        <li>Examples of work developed and record of process.</li>
        <li>Observations and reflections on internship.</li>
        <li>Summary of internship experience and contribution to your program.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>Intern's Midterm and Final Assessments submitted to faculty sponsor:</p>
      <p>a. Mid-term assessment to the faculty sponsor by (date): <span data-field="assessment.midterm_date">{{ assessment.midterm_date }}</span></p>
      <p>b. Final assessment to the faculty sponsor by (date): <span data-field="assessment.final_date">{{ assessment.final_date }}</span></p>
      <p>Assessment form are available on <a href="http://uwadmnweb.uwyo.edu/art/" style="color: black;">http://uwadmnweb.uwyo.edu/art/</a></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>Intern Supervisor's Midterm and Final Assessments submitted to faculty sponsor:</p>
      <p>a. Mid-term assessment by (date): <span data-field="supervisor_assessment.midterm_date">{{ supervisor_assessment.midterm_date }}</span></p>
      <p>b. Final assessment by (date): <span data-field="supervisor_assessment.final_date">{{ supervisor_assessment.final_date }}</span></p>
      <p>Assessment form are available on <a href="http://uwadmnweb.uwyo.edu/art/" style="color: black;">http://uwadmnweb.uwyo.edu/art/</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">AGENCY/ORGANIZATION REQUIREMENTS</h2>

  <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Agency/organization will provide adequate supervision of intern.</li>
    <li>Intern will comply with organization's policies and procedures.</li>
